    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p data-end="439" data-start="200"><strong data-end="242" data-start="200">Stock and online store synchronization</strong><br data-end="245" data-start="242"/>Your stock is in a spreadsheet, your store is on Shopify or WooCommerce, and your accounting is in another tool. The result: stock errors, overselling, and hours of manual data entry every week.</p><p data-end="668" data-start="441"><strong data-end="480" data-start="441">Logistics and multichannel shipping</strong><br data-end="483" data-start="480"/>Manually managing carriers, labels, and parcel tracking becomes unmanageable as soon as volume increases. Without automation, your team spends more time handling shipments than selling.</p><p data-end="915" data-start="670"><strong data-end="707" data-start="670">VAT, OSS &amp; Intrastat declarations</strong><br data-end="710" data-start="707"/>As soon as you sell in several EU countries, VAT becomes a headache: country-specific rates, OSS thresholds, monthly Intrastat
      declarations. A single mistake can be costly in penalties and correction time.</p><p data-end="1162" data-start="917"><strong data-end="952" data-start="917">Returns and after-sales service</strong><br data-end="955" data-start="952"/>Processing returns without a centralized customer history creates negative experiences and losses that are difficult to trace. Every poorly managed return is costly for your brand image and your team’s time.</p><p data-end="1350" data-start="1164"><strong data-end="1194" data-start="1164">Margin analysis by product</strong><br data-end="1197" data-start="1194"/>Without a unified dashboard, it is impossible to know which products or channels are truly profitable. Purchasing and pricing decisions are made blindly.</p>'
